<section class="services-faq-section py-5 bg-light" id="faq">
    <div class="container py-md-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center text-center mb-5">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <h2 class="fs-2 fw-bold mb-3"
                    data-aos="fade-up"
                    data-aos-duration="1000">
                    Your Questions, Our <span style="color: var(--primary-color);">Answers</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="lead text-muted"
                   data-aos="fade-up"
                   data-aos-duration="1200"
                   data-aos-delay="200">
                    Find here the answers to the most frequently asked questions about our <strong>financing services</strong>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10">
                <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="faqAccordionServices">
                    <div class="accordion-item"
                         data-aos="fade-up"
                         data-aos-duration="1000"
                         data-aos-delay="300">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                            <button class="accordion-button fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                                What documents are required for a loan application?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionServices">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                <p>Generally, you will need proof of identity, proof of address, payslips (or financial statements for professionals), recent tax notices, bank statements, and information about your project (sales agreement, quotes, etc.). A detailed list will be provided by your advisor.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item"
                         data-aos="fade-up"
                         data-aos-duration="1000"
                         data-aos-delay="400">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                How long does it take to get a response?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionServices">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                <p>The response time varies depending on the type of financing and the responsiveness of the lending institutions. However, with our tools and network, we strive to speed up the process and provide you with a quick response, often within 48 to 72 hours after receiving a complete application.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item"
                         data-aos="fade-up"
                         data-aos-duration="1000"
                         data-aos-delay="500">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                                Are your services chargeable for the client?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionServices">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                <p>Our fees are usually defined as a percentage of the amount of financing obtained and are clearly indicated in the search mandate we sign together. Part of our services may be covered by banking partners depending on agreements. Full transparency is guaranteed before any commitment.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item"
                         data-aos="fade-up"
                         data-aos-duration="1000"
                         data-aos-delay="600">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                                Can I apply for financing online?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionServices">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                <p>Yes, you can initiate your financing request directly via our contact form or online simulator. An advisor will then contact you to refine your needs and compile your file, whether remotely or in branch.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item"
                         data-aos="fade-up"
                         data-aos-duration="1000"
                         data-aos-delay="700">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                                What are the conditions to benefit from your services?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionServices">
                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                <p>Our services are intended for individuals and professionals who meet certain solvency criteria and have a clear, feasible financing project. Each application is individually reviewed by our experts.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
